You are a senior Laravel engineer. Build a **production-grade Coaching / Class Management System** as a **Laravel 11 (PHP 8.3+) MVC application**. This is an **admin-only, role-based, authenticated backend system**. There is **NO public landing page**. The root URL `/` redirects to `/login`. Follow every instruction below **exactly**.

