## 🎯 4. ROOT ROUTE BEHAVIOR (No Landing Page)

In `routes/web.php`:

```php
Route::get('/', function () {
    return auth()->check()
        ? redirect()->route('admin.dashboard')
        : redirect()->route('login');
});
```

- `/` → redirects to `/login` if not authenticated
- `/` → redirects to `/admin/dashboard` if authenticated
- Public user registration **disabled** (`RegisteredUserController` removed or gated)
- Only **Super Admin** can create new staff/teacher/student/parent accounts
- No `/courses`, `/faculty`, `/admission` public pages

