### 6.2 Module Input Specifications

#### Staff (Admin/Teacher/Accountant/Receptionist)
- `full_name` (text, req), `email` (req, unique), `phone` (req, unique, E.164), `password` (req, min 8), `role_id` (select, req), `subjects[]` (multi-select if teacher), `batches[]` (multi), `joining_date` (date ≤ today), `salary` (decimal), `photo` (image ≤2MB), `status` (Active/Suspended), `notes`

#### Course
- `name` (req, unique), `code` (req, unique), `category` (select: Class 8–12 / JEE / NEET / Foundation), `duration_months` (1–36), `total_fee` (decimal ≥0), `installments_allowed` (1–12), `admission_fee` (decimal), `status` (Active/Archived), `description` (textarea max 1000)

#### Batch
- `name` (req, unique per course), `course_id` (select), `teacher_id` + `co_teacher_id` (search-select), `start_date`, `end_date` (> start), `class_days[]` (weekday checkboxes), `start_time`, `end_time` (> start), `room`, `max_capacity` (1–500), `status` (Upcoming/Ongoing/Completed/Cancelled)
- **Validation logic:** reject if `enrolled_count >= max_capacity` on new student assignment
- **Transfer tool:** source batch → target batch, students[], move/copy, effective date, notify checkbox

#### Student Admission
- `full_name`, `email` (optional, unique), `phone` (req, unique), `parent_name`, `parent_phone`, `dob` (≤ today), `gender`, `address_line1/2`, `city`, `state`, `zip`, `school_name`, `current_class` (select), `batch_id` (search-select — only capacity-available), `admission_date` (≤ today), `total_fee` (auto from course), `discount_amount` (≤ total, req reason if >0), `discount_reason` (Sibling/Merit/Staff Ward/Other), `final_fee` (auto), `payment_plan` (Full/Installments N), `first_payment_amount`, `payment_method` (Cash/Card/UPI/Bank), `payment_ref`, `photo`, `id_proof` (req, PDF/JPG ≤5MB), `status`, `send_welcome_sms` toggle
- **Auto-logic:** on save, create `student_batch` pivot row, generate `fee_plans` rows based on `payment_plan`, generate roll number, write `audit_logs`, queue welcome SMS

#### Fee Collection
- `student_id` (search-select showing outstanding), `installment_id` (select, auto-populated), `amount_paid` (> 0, ≤ outstanding + advance allowed), `payment_method`, `reference_number` (req if non-cash), `payment_date` (≤ today), `late_fee` (auto-calc if overdue), `late_fee_waived` (toggle → req `waive_reason`), `receipt_note`, `auto_send_receipt` toggle
- **On submit:** DB transaction → insert `fee_payments`, update balance, generate receipt PDF via `ReceiptService`, queue SMS+Email, write audit log

#### Fee Plan Builder (per course)
- `course_id`, `installment_no`, `due_after_days`, `amount`, `late_fee_per_day`, `grace_days` — repeatable rows

#### Refund
- `student_id`, `total_paid` (read-only), `refund_amount` (≤ paid), `refund_method` (Original/Cash/Bank), `reason` (Batch Cancelled/Withdrawal/Duplicate/Other), `reason_notes` (req if Other), `approver` (auto), `confirm` checkbox

#### Attendance
