### 6.6 Audit Logging

`AuditLogger` middleware on all admin/teacher routes:
```php
AuditLog::create([
    'user_id'    => auth()->id(),
    'action'     => $request->method().' '.$request->path(),
    'entity'     => $entity,
    'entity_id'  => $entityId,
    'old_values' => json_encode($oldValues),
    'new_values' => json_encode($newValues),
    'ip'         => $request->ip(),
    'user_agent' => $request->userAgent(),
]);
```

Table is **append-only** — no update/delete allowed.

