### 6.7 Security Rules

- All DB writes in `DB::transaction()`
- All money stored as `decimal(12,2)`
- All file uploads validated (mime, size) + stored in `storage/app/private/` for sensitive docs
- All passwords bcrypt/argon2
- All sensitive fields (`id_proof` path, bank info) encrypted cast
- CSRF on all forms
- Login rate-limited 5/min
- Session timeout 15 min idle
- No `dd()`/`dump()` left in code
- No editing `vendor/`

